This program uses a `while` loop to ensure the user enters a valid age (a positive integer). If the user enters a non-integer value or a non-positive integer, the program will prompt them to enter a valid age again. Once the user enters a valid age, the program checks if the age is 18 or older and prints the appropriate message.
